  "description": "Amplified is the debut solo studio album by American rapper Q-Tip, released on November 30, 1999, through Arista Records. It was recorded following the disbandment of his former group A Tribe Called Quest in 1998, and the production was primarily handled by himself and Jay Dee of the Ummah. The album spawned the Billboard Hot 100 singles \"Vivrant Thing\" and \"Breathe and Stop\".",
